# test-patch-lists-current - the docs' patch lists say what the headers say (issue 189f)
#
# For a general audience: the patch registry and each profile's page list
# that profile's patches, written by scripts/generate-patch-lists from the
# patches' own headers. A header changed without the lists being written
# again leaves a page saying something no longer true; this fails until
# they are (run scripts/generate-patch-lists, which says which pages it
# rewrote).
#
# Usage: scripts/test-patch-lists-current [PROJECT_DIR]

DIR="/mnt/kaun/wow-chat-2026"
[[ -n "${1:-}" ]] && DIR="$1"
"${DIR}/scripts/generate-patch-lists" "${DIR}" --check
# ==== footer of test-patch-lists-current ====
# lines:      26
# ==== end of footer ====
